{
  "$comment": "The corpus shards: the one place the matrix and the scorecard's expected-shard list come from (.github/workflows/corpus.yml plan job). The Playwright gallery's reference is its own shard; every other mode runs with --reference-later and the scorecard job compares it with the reference's answers; `twice` runs as two claim halves (--slice). A mode that does not apply to the subject has no shard: the scorecard records it as not applicable (corpus/lib/deferred.mjs). timeout is minutes, about 2x the measured shard time. test/corpus-shards.test.mjs checks that every subject, mode and mutant is in exactly one shard.",
